 <COL N="0147C"></COL> qemevnou ejpiú thún tautwðn metavfrasin ejk thðû 2Rwmaivaû
eijû thún 2Ellavda glwðttan, oJ ejk thðû aænwqen</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0147" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0147D"></COL> Mss.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>qeivaû rJophðû</FOREIGN> .</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rJophðû yhfisqeiúû
poimhvn te kaiú poimenavrchû kaiú oJdhgoúû ojrqodovxou
