 <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0155" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0155D"></COL> Reg.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>katabavsewû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>katagwghðû ejk plagivou touð oærouû ejlqwún ptwðsin touð
