hJ thðû zwhðû ejleuqeriva,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0155" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0155D"></COL> Mss.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejk twðn uJpodeigmavtwn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn twðé uJpodeivgmati twðn ajsqenestevrwn
