iJstavmenon, taúû kandhvlaû skeuavzein. Pavnu gaúr</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0179" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0179D"></COL> Uterque Cod.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>semnoúû uJphðrcen</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>stenoúû
