twðé diakeimevnwé plhsivon thðû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="i" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0182" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0182D"></COL> Reg.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Nemesivaû.</FOREIGN>  Colb.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Nespesivaû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Nepesivaû povlewû, oåper
