thðé makroqumivaé uJpevferen. Kaiú ouåtw toiðû ajdelfoiðû ejn
praéovthti proièstato, wåste toún touð patroúû qumoún, diaú
thðû eJautouð tapeinofrosuvnhû pavntote katepravéuçne. Toú
deú aujtoú monasthvrion ejn thðé ajkrotavthé touð oærouû korufhðé
diakeivmenon uJpavrcei× oåqen proúû toú poihðsai toiðû ajdelfoiðû
mikroún khpavrion oujdemiva ijsovthû ejn twðé tovpwé ejfaivneto.
1En deú twðé touð oærouû plagivwé</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0183" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0183D"></COL> Colb. habet adhuc  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>semnovû,</FOREIGN>  pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>stenovû</FOREIGN> ; Reg.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>mikrovû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>stenoúû tovpoû uJphðrcen,
