twðn touð 1Elissaivou</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0183" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0183D"></COL> Colb.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>nohðsai.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>gnwrivsai_</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0183"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>PETR. Qevlw kaiú pavnu ejpiqumwð.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0183"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>GRHG. 1Elaivou poteú ejn twðé monasthrivwé leiðyiû gevgonen,
