 <COL N="0186D"></COL> ejk thðû korufhðû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0186" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0186D"></COL> Colb.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touð oærouû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touð livqou ejklhvqhsan. 2O deú ajdelfoúû
