kaiú stenwvsei uJparcwn. 4Ote deú loipoún oJ kairoúû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0190" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0190D"></COL> Colb.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eæfqasen touð.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>katevlabe
touð wJrimavsai aujtouúû touúû ejnapomeivnantaû ojlivgouû
bovtruaû, fuvlaka touð ajmpelwðnoû kataú toú eæqoû katevsthse×
kaiú touðton ajlruvpnwé fulakhðé threiðsqai ejkevleusen. 1En
