oiænou skeuvh</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="k" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0190" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0190D"></COL> Idem Cod.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>plhqunqwðsi.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>plhqunqwðsi, kaiú pissoqwðsi, kaqwúû eæqoû
uJphðrcen. 4Oper oJ presbuvteroû oJ aujtouð ajneyioúû ajkouvsaû,
livan ejqauvmasen, oåti oiønon mhú eæcwn, taú skeuvh touð oiønou
eJtoimavsai ajnugiwðû ejkevleusen. Ouj mevn toiv ge ejpetovlmhsen
 <COL N="0190C"></COL> ejkzhthðsai, diativ toiauðta prosevtaxen, ajllaú thðé keleuvsei
aujtouð uJpakouvsaû, pavnta kataú toú eæqoû hJtoivmase. Tovte oJ
aænqrwpoû touð Qeouð eijû toún ajmpelwðna eijselqwún, thún euJreqeiðsan
stafulhún sunavxaû, eijû thún lhnoún ajphvgagen, kaiú
pavntaû ejkeiðqen</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="l" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0190" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0190D"></COL> Mss.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejxelqeiðn ejkevleusen, kaiú movnoû metaú semnouð.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejxelqeiðn keleuvsaû, movnoû metaú eJnoúû
