2Hnivka deú ejx aujtwðn oiønoû ojlivgoû proelqeiðn hærxato,
touðton oJ touð Qeouð aænqrwpoû taiðû ijdivaiû cersiún ejn</FOREIGN> 
 <NOTE N="m" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0190" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0190D"></COL> Reg.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>mikrotavtwé.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>semnotavtwé ajggeivwé dexavmenoû, eijû oåla taú eJtoimasqevnta
skeuvh eujlogivaû cavrin diemevrisen× wåste movliû pavnta taú
