twðé pantodunavmwé Qewðé douleuvwn, oåstiû diaú twðn
eærgwn thún politeivan faneraún ajpevdeixen. 1En miaðé gaúr twðn
hJmerwðn,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0211" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0211C"></COL> Colb.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oiJ aujtouð ajdelfoiv.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>oiJ uJp1 aujtoún ajdelfoiú, uJpospovdion aærton pepoihvkasi,
