twðn ajpostovlwn_</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0214"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>PETR. 1Asfalwðû oiøda,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="k" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0214" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0214D"></COL> Mss.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú pevpeismai, kaiú distagmovû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú distagmoúû ejn touvtwé oujk
