ejstiú,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="l" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0214" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0214D"></COL> Reg.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>pleiðon pavntwn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>pleivw pavntwn ejkopivase.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0214"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>GRHG. Kaqwúû ejpivstasai, Pevtroû ejn thðé qalasshé toiðû
