ejcqrouð palaivsmata proqumouvmenoû× eijshðlqe toivnun</FOREIGN> 
 <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0226" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0226D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú ejn aujtwðé katevmeinen.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú ejp1 aujtouð katevmeinen. 1En deú thðé nukterinhðé hJsucivaé,
