mevllomen_ Proúû ouÝû diaú touð thðû profhteivaû pneuvmatoû
ajpekrivqh, levgwn× Metaú Kwnstavntion</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0234" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0234D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>staulauvrion.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>staulavrhn, metaú
staulavrhn knafeva. Oujaiv soi, povliû 1Akuivnh, oåti kaiú touðto
