Touð deú ejpiskovpou ejn twðé mevswé ejnecqevntoû,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0238" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0238D"></COL> Hanc vocem, pro  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aærktoû,</FOREIGN>  usurpari observat Cangius,
