wjmovthtoû uJpourgoiú touðton krathvsanteû, kaiú kuvklwvé aujtouð
peristavnteû, ejn eJniú tovpwé sthðnai aujtoún ejkevleusan, trocoún
 <COL N="0239D"></COL> ejn thðé ghðé</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0239" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0239D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>caravxanteû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>tupwvsanteû, iåna toún povda aujtouð eæxwqen tanuvsai
