ejpilampomevnhû, proúû thún parouðsan caraún paresuvreto_</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0247"><COL N="0250A"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>GRHGOR. Megavlh, Pevtre, uJpavrcei touð pantodunavmou
Qeouð hJ oijkonomiva. 4Oqen pollavkiû sumbaivnei, oåti megavla</FOREIGN> <HI REND=BOLD>307</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajgaqav tisi parevcousa, paracwreið ejn touvtoiû
