 <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0249" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0249D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>polevmwé krathvswsi</FOREIGN> .</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>povlemon krothvswsin, kaiú megivstwn ejcqrwðn par1 aujtwðn
