zhðé, eæxw thðû sarkoúû uJpavrcei. Qeva loipoún pwðû zhðé
oåstiû ejk</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0266" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0266D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejk touð ajduvtou noovû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touð aåédou touð noovû proúû thún thðû eujsplagcnivaû
