Tovte hJ</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="h" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0271" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0271D"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejkeivnh parqevnoû ajnas.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aJgiwtavth ejkeivnh qhvleia ajnastaðsa, aujsthrwðé
