soi, kaiú touúû ajmfotevrouû cwrhðsai toú mnhðma ouj duvnatai.
2O deú hJgouvmenoû proúû aujtoún eæfh× Ouåtw poivhson kaqwúû
eiøpovn soi, oåti toú mnhðmav sou touúû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0275" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0275D"></COL> Ed.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>duvo hJmwðn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>duvo hJmaðû eæcei cwrhðsai.
1Apevqanen ouøn, kaiú eijû toú mnhðma, oåper eJautwðé oJ
