ejstravfh eijû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0278" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0278D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eijû plhvgion.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>plavghn, kaiú tovpon ejn twðé mnhvmati parevscen,
ejn wßé ojfeivlei touð presbutevrou toú swðma</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0278" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0278D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>teqhðnai.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>teqeiðnai.
Kaiú oåper zwðn uJpevsceto, nekroúû ejplhvrwse× touúû gaúr
