ejkeiðnoû eijû thún touð makarivou Pauvlou touð 1Apostovlou
ejkklhsivan thún ouøsan ejkeiðse ejn aællhé hJmevraé eijselqeiðn</FOREIGN> 
 <NOTE N="i" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0286" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0286D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ceiriú.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>braciúoni diebebaiwvsato. Touðto deú oJ thðû aujthðû ejkklhsivaû
fuvlax ajkhkowúû, spoudaivwû dramwún thún ejkklhsivan
hjsfavlisen. 2Espevraû deú genomevnhû pavsaû taúû kandhvlaû
eæsbese, kaiú eJautoún ejn toiðû naouð ejndotavtoiû katevkruyen.
Touð deú fwtoúû thðû hJmevraû ejpakolouqhvsantoû, ejn aujthðé thðé
aujghðé oJ 1Areianoúû ejpivskopoû sunavxaû plhðqoû laouð ejn thðé
