 <NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0286" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0286D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>hæcou.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>hæcouû ajnewvécqhsan. Fwtoúû deú aænwqen ejkcuqevntoû
ejsbesmevnai kandhðlai paðsai ajnhvfqhsan. 2O deú 1Areianoúû
