touð ijdivou patroúû sfagevntoû.</FOREIGN></HEAD> <COL N="0290B"></COL> <P COM="0290"><COL N="0290C"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>GRHGORIOS. Kaqwúû paraú pollwðn twðn nuðn ejrcomevnwn
