Qumwqeiúû deú oJ touvtou pathúr ejstevrhsen aujtoún thðû
basileivaû, kaiú pavntwn twðn pragmavtwn touðton ejguvmnwsen.
 <COL N="0290D"></COL> Mhdeú</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="k" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0290" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0290D"></COL> Fortasse,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ouåtwû,</FOREIGN>  cum in Latino textu legatur,
