poihvsaû</FOREIGN> ;</P> <P COM="0293"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>PETR. 1Arevskei oÝ levgeiû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0293"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>GRHGOR. Oußtoi toivnun ejn ejkeivnwé twðé kairwðé provsfugoi
