Touðton toún aændra, tosauvthû dunavmewû uJpavrconta,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0302" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0302D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ijdeiðn ejpequvmhsa.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>pavnu
