touð ploivou</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0303" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0303D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>hJlwvmata sunespavsqhsan, toú katavrtion sunetrivbh,
taú aærmena</FOREIGN> .</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>hJlwvmata ajnespavsqhsan, toú katavrtin ejklavsqh,
taú aærmena ejn thðé qalavsshé ejrjrJivfhsan, kaiú oålon toú
ploiðon ejk thðû twðn kumavtwn bivaû donhqeún, ejk pavshû auJtouð
aJrmonivaû dieluvqh. Twðn ouøn aJrmwðn, wJû eiærhtai, dialuqentwn,
eændon hJ qavlassa eijselqouðsa, eåwû twðn ajnwtevrw
sanivdwn toú ploiðon ejgevmisen, wåste oujciú tosouðton ejn toiðû
kuvmasin eiønai toú ploiðon, oåson eændon touð ploivou taú kuvmata.
4Oqen loipoún pavnteû oiJ ejn twðé ploivwé, oujciú geitniazonta
toún qavnaton, ajllaú toiðû ojfqalmoiðû parovnta aujtoún qewrouðnteû,
ejn pollhðé tarachðé gegonovteû, eJautouúû hjspavsanto,
kaiú touð swvmatoû kaiú aiåmatoû touð lutrwtouð
