uJpodevxhtai, wßn taú swvmata ejn toiouvtwé foberwðé qanavtwé
 <COL N="0303D"></COL> paradoqhðnai sunecwvrhsen. 2O deú pantoduvnamoû Qeoúû,
oJ touúû aujtwðn logismouúû foberwðû kataplhvxaû, thún touvtwn
zwhún qaumasivwû ejfuvlaxen. Mevcri gaúr hJmerwðn
 <COL N="0306A"></COL> ojktwú toú aujtwðn ploiðon eåwû twðn ajnwtevrw sanivdwn, wJû
eiærhtai, gemismevnon uådati, thún ijdivan oJdoún dianuvon,
eæpleen. Thðé deú ejnnavthé hJmevraé ejn twðé limevni touð</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0306" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0306D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kavstrou Krwtwvnhû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kavstrou
Kotrwvnhû wJdhghvqh. Pavntwn deú touð ploivou ajpobavntwn,
twðn metaú touð prolecqevntoû eujlabestavtou ajndroúû Maximianouð
