 <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0318" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0318B"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>wæfeilon.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>wæfelon. 1Allaú tauvtaû sighðé kaluvptw diaú toú eijû eåterav me speuvdein.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0317"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>PETR. Pollouúû twðn eændon oæntwn touð kovlpou thðû aJgivaû
