4Eteron deú, sarkiú meún</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0322" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0322D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaluvptetai, oujc aåma.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaluptovmenon, oujciú deú
