 <COL N="0322B"></COL> toj twðn ajnqrwvpwn. Toú deú thðé sarkiú kaluptovmenon
pneuðma, kaiú metaú thðû sarkoúû ajpoqnhðskon, toú twðn
kthnwðn. 2O aænqrwpoû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0322" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0322D"></COL> Secuti sumus constructionem Ms. In Editis vero
legitur,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>toivnun, katwvteroû wÞn touð ajggevlou oåstiû ejn
