ejaún aujtwðé tiû eæti pnohú zwtikhú uJphðrcen. 4Oper ejkeiðnoû
ejpignouúû,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0338" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0338D"></COL> Forte,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaivtoi.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kaiú ti livan leptotavthû aujtwðé pnohðû uJparcouvshû,
thðé ejpineuvsei deú</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="h" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0338" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0338D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>maðllon touð Qeouð qerman.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>maðllon qermanqevntoû touð
pneuvmatoû, oåshn hjdunhvqh swreuðsai pnohún touð lalhðsai,
