ejn tauvthé thðé povlei</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="i" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0338" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0338D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>monasthrivou proivstatai rJeavthû ejponomazomevnou.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>monasthrivwé proièstatai, 2Renavthû
