ajnamonhún thðû ejxovdou thðû yuchðû aujtouð yalmwédivan twðé
Qewðé aæéswsin. 1En oåswé deú suún aujtoiðû kaiú aujtoúû oJ teleutwðn
eæyallen, aiæfnhû touvtouû touð yavllein ejkwvluse metaú
fovbou kaiú kraughðû megavlhû, levgwn× Siwpaðte, mhú gaúr
oujk ajkouvete pwðû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0343" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0343D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aujthcouðsin.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajnthcwðsin aijnevseiû ejn twðé oujranwðé_
Eijû ouøn taúû aijnevseiû ejkeivnaû prosevcwn, wJû oåti eændon ejn
 <COL N="0343B"></COL> toiðû wjsiún thðû kardivaû aujtouð touvtwn hækouen, hJ aJgiva
ejkeivnh yuchú ejk twðn desmwðn touð swvmatoû ajpeluvqh. Tauvthû
