te kaiú gunaikwðn eujgenwðn ajpoqnhskovntwn, pollouúû paragivnesqai,</FOREIGN> 
 <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0347" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0347D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejpiú twðé toún plhsivon.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejpiú toú touúû plhsivon aujtwðn paramuqhvsasqai,
