pevrix thðû klivnhû aujthðû parivstanto. Aiæfnhû deú
aujthðû aænw qeasamevnhû, eiøde toún 1Ihsouðn ejrcovmenon, kaiú
metaú</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0347" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0347D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>meg. caraðû kaiú proq.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>megivsthû yuchðû proqumivaû hærxato toiðû paristamevnoiû
aujthðé metaú kraughðû levgein× 1Apovsthte, ajpovsthte,
oJ 1Ihsouðû eærcetai. 1En deú twðé prosevcein aujthún eijû oånper
ejqewvrei, hJ aJgiva ejkeivnh yuchú ejk touð swvmatoû ejxhðlqe.
Tosauvth deú oæsfrhsiû qaumasthðû eujwdivaû ejkeiðse ejxecuvqh,
wåste diaú tauvthû thðû ojsfrhvsewû paðsi katavdhlon
