deú toú mhnuvsai</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0351" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0351D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>prosevqeto.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>proevqeto, levgwn× Oujaiú oujaiú, pavter Stevfane,
tiv soi sunevbh_ Aujtoúû deú iJlarwðé twðé proswvpwé kaiú
