 <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0352" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0352D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajpwvlese.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>hæpollen, kaiú maðllon aujtwðé uJpeúr ejkeivnou touð thún aJrartivan
