tiv mevllei aujtoiðû uJpavrcein, eij kaiú proúû toú paroún
pikrwðé qanavtwé teleuthvswsin_ pollavkiû deú kaiú mikroún
ptaiðsma touvtoiû uJpolevleiptai, oåper ejn aujtwðé twðé qanavtwé
ejkkophðnai ojfeivlei, oåqen kaiú sumbaivnei, eæti</FOREIGN>   <HI REND=BOLD>407</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>zwvntwn
aujtwðn, touúû ejnantivouû kat1 aujtwðn ejxousivan labeiðn, iåna
teleutwvntwn aujtwðn hJ ejkdivkhsiû eijû thún ejkeivnwn wjmovthta</FOREIGN> 
 <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0355" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0355D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>diaú touvtwn aujtwðn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touvtwn aujtwðn genhvsetai. Kaqavper kaiú ejpiú touvtou touð
sarkobovrou, touð paracwrhqevntoû zwðnta toún eujlabevstaton
diavkonon krouðsai. 1Allaú nekrwqevntoû aujtouð ouj sunecwrhvqh,
 <COL N="0355C"></COL> kaqwúû kaiú taú iJeraú lovgia marturouðsin. 1Epeidhú
