6On gaúr oJ aujtoúû levwn zwðnta foneuðsai ejtovlmhse, touvtou
aåyasqai foneuqevntoû oujk ejtovlmhse. Foneuðsai meún gaúr
ejxousivan eælaben, ejk deú touð ptwvmatoû touð</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0355" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0355D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>qanovntoû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>qanevntoû fageiðn
aædeian oujk eælaben. 1Epeidhú gaúr ejkeiðnoû oJ ejn thðé zwhðé
