twðn teteleiwmevnwn dikaivwn aiJ yucaiú, eujqevwû hJnivka ejk
twðn thðû sarkoúû kleivqrwn ejxevlqwsin, ejn taiðû oujranivaiû
kaqevdraiû uJpodevcontai, fanerwvteron touð fwtoúû kaqevsthken.
Aujthú gaúr hJ ajlhvqeia di1 eJauthðû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0358" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0358D"></COL> Editi,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>marturoið.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>martureið, levgousa×
4Opou toú swðma, ejkeið sunacqhvsontai oiJ ajetoiv. Toutevstin
