dikaiosuvnhû auJtwðn mevllousin ajpolabeiðn_</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0358"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>GRHG. Touðto aujtoiðû ejn thðé krivsei qaumasivwû uJpavrxei×
nuðn gaúr twðn yucwðn movnon, tovte deú kaiú twðn swmavtwn thún
