 <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0359" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0359D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kovdeoû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kounkodevouû gaúr oJ ajdbokaðtoû, oåstiû ejn tauvthé thðé povlei
