 <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0359" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0359D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>gegonwðsi.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>gegovnasi dievgnwmen. 1En gaúr twðé ejmwðé monasthrivwé
