oijkouðntoû. Oußtoû gaúr oJ ajnhúr taiðû pravxesin ejlehmosuvnhû
ejfrovntize, proú deú pavntwn thðé</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0363" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0363D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>filoxenivaé.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>xenodocivaé proseiðcen,
