swmatikwðé puriú krathqhvsetai_</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0366"><HI REND=BOLD>418</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>PETR. Touvtou eåneken ejn toiðû zwðsi toú ajswvmaton
pneuðma ejn twðé swvmati krateiðtai, ejpeidhv touðto zwopoieið
toú swðma.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0366"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>GRHGOR. 1Eaún toú ajswvmaton pneuðma, Pevtre, krathqhðnai
 <COL N="0367A"></COL> ejn twðé swvmati duvnatai oåper zwopoieið, diaú tiv oujciú
