qugatevra tinoúû newtevran uJpavrcousan ejn twðé</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0371" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0371D"></COL> Ms.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aJgivw bapt</FOREIGN> .</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>baptivsmati
ejdevxato. 4Ostiû metaú thún nhsteivan ejn twðé oiækwé
