oJmoivwû aJmarthvsantaû oJmoivwû kaiú ejn</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0382" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0382D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn toiðû basavnoiû</FOREIGN> .</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>toiðû twðn basavnwn tovpoiû uJpoú twðn ajggevlwn ajpenecqhðnai.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0381"><COL N="0382A"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>PETR. Proúû thún ejkzhvthsin thðû ejrwthvsewvû mou hJ plhroforiva
diaú thðû ajpologivaû ajpedeivcqh. 1All1 aijtwð, tiv ejsti
