 <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0387" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0387D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>bhvsala</FOREIGN> .</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>bivsala eijû thún touð oiækou oijkodomhún gevronteû kaiú newvteroi.
kovrai te kaiú pa iðdeû parevferon. 4Oqen deivknutai
