Periú thðû krivsewû twðn Sodomitwðn.</FOREIGN></HEAD> <COL N="0390B"></COL> <P COM="0390"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>GRHGORIOS. Duvnatai× ajkhkovamen gaúr</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0390" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0390D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>thðû bivblou thðû gennevsewû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>bivblou thðû Genevsewû
marturouvshû, oåti eæbrexe kuvrioû eijû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="h" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0390" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0390D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejpiú touvû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touúû Sodomivtaû
puðr kaiú qeiðon, iåna toú meún puðr touvtouû katakauvshé,
