Di1 oujdeún</FOREIGN>   <HI REND=BOLD>446</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eåteron ejn touvtwé twðé tovpwé thðû krivsewû
wJrivsqhn, eij mhú</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0398" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0398D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>di1 wßn eijû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>di1 oÝn eijû mevroû Laurentivou sunhvénesa,
