touð nooúû diaugivaé tauðta wåsper proú touð hJlivou oJrwðmen.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0399"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>PETR. 1Arevskei oÝ levgeiû, ajllaú periú tou toiouvtou ajndroúû
