 <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0405" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0405D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>diaú toún logismovn.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>diaú twðn logismwðn proskollhqevnteû, oujdeún pantavpasi
tolmwðsi duswphðsai, oåper thðé eændon aujtouð ajkribestavthé
