ejktivsqhmen kaiú gegovnamen× toutevstin, eåterovn ejsti</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="h" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0406" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0406D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>makarivwû eiønai.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>makarivwû
zhðsai, kaiú eåteron oujsiwdwðû. 2H yuchú ouøn kaiú qnhthú
uJpavrcein noeiðtai, kaiú ajqavnatoû. Qnhthú ouøn, oåti makarivwû
