Merouvllou twðn monacwðn.</FOREIGN></HEAD> <COL N="0406D"></COL> <P COM="0406"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Pollavkiû deú kaiú proú thðû teleuthðû oJ pantoduvnamoû
