kaiú katanuvxewû, oåpwû diaú touvtwn oJ logismoúû aujtouð ajnanhvyaû,
taú ejpivgeia katalipwún, ejn</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>thðé ejpouranivou patrivdoû qewrivaé.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>thðé ejpouranivwé patrivdi
diaú qewrivaû metavrsioû gevnhtai. Touvtwé ouøn diaú nukterinhðû
