aåpax ajkouvsaû, ejn megavlwé fovbwé kaiú</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>deilivaé gevgonen.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>deilivaé eæti uJphðrcen.
1En deú eJtevraé nuktiú pavlin toiðû aujtoiðû lovgoiû ejcrhmativsqh.
Metaú deú pevnte hJmevraû puretwðé susceqeiúû, pavntwn twðn
 <COL N="0407B"></COL> ajdelfwðn klaiovntwn kaiú eujcomevnwn proúû kuvrion ejxedhvmhsen.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0407"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>4Eteroû deú ajdelfoúû ejn twðé aujtwðé monasthrivwé Mevroulloû
