 <NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0407" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0407D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejpeidhú crovnon.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejpeiú crovnon ejpivmhkon ejnqavde poihðsai oujk eæceiû. 1En wßé
