aæggeloû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="j" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0410" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0410D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejcrhmavtise levgwn, paravlabe toú paidivon kaiú
feuðge eijû Aiægupton.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejcrhmavtisen ejpaðrai toú paidivon kaiú feuvgein
eijû Aiægupton. 2Omoivwû deú pavlin, eij mhú diaú twðn logismwðn
oJmouð kaiú di1 ajpokaluvyewû taú ejnuvpnia prohvrconto, oujk
aÞn Danihúl oJ profhvthû thún touð Naboucodonovswr oårasin
eJrmhneuvwn, ajpoú thðû rJivzhû diaú touð logismouð hærxato, levgwn×
Suú, basileuð, ejpiú thðû koivthû sou dialogivsasqai hærxou tiv
mevllei eæsesqai. Metaú deú touðto, kaiv oJ ajpokaluvptwn musthvria
