 <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>panagavqou.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajgaqouð pneuvmatoû lambavnousi, tiv deú paraú touð</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411C"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>planwðntoû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejmpaivzontoû
uJpomevnousin. 1Eaún gaúr oJ nouðû periú twðn toiouvtwn
ejn ajsfaleivaé ouj diaginwvskei,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0411" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0411D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn pollaiðû ajpavtaiû aujtoún toú parad.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ejn pollaiðû aujtwðn ajpavtaiû
