swmatikwðé hJ aujthú qhvleia ejkeiðse katekavh. 1Ex ouß pravgmatoû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0414" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0414D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>fanerwðû deivknutai wßn aiJ aJmartivai sugkecwrhmevnai
