oiJ fuvlakeû, qewrouðsi duvo</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0415" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0415D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>tinaú kaiú frhkwvdh.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>tinaú kaiú frikwvdh
pneuvmata touð aujtouð Balentivnou touúû povdaû desmwðé tini
sfivgxanta, kaiú eæxw thðû ejkklhsivaû aujtoún suvronta, sfodrwðû
pavnu klaivonta kaiú ojdurovmenon. 1Epiú deú touðto katapthvxanteû,
