in verbis, non in sensu.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJpofevrein oujk hjdunhvqhn makroquvmwû. 1Aeiú gaúr hJ touð
hJmetevrou monasthrivou tavxiû uJphðrcen, iåna pavnteû oiJ
