 <HI REND="ITALIC">De vita et transitu Cassii Narniensis episcopi.</HI></HEAD> <COL N="0421C"></COL> <P COM="0421">PETRUS. Mira sunt valde quae audio, et non mediocriter
laeta.</P> <P COM="0421">GREGOR. Ne nobis in dubium veniant verba mortuorum,
confirmant haec facta viventium. Nam vir
vitae venerabilis <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0421" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0421D"></COL> In sacras tabulas relatus est ad d. 29 Junii. Quae hic
de eo referuntur, fusius explicantur hom. 37 in Evang.</NOTE>  Cassius Narniensis episcopus, qui
quotidianum offerre consueverat Deo sacrificium, seque
 <COL N="0421D"></COL> in lacrymis inter ipsa sacrificiorum arcana mactabat;
mandatum Domini per cujusdam sui presbyteri
visionem suscepit, dicens: Age quod agis, operare
 <COL N="0424A"></COL> quod operaris, non cesset pes tuus, non cesset
manus tua, natali Apostolorum venies ad me, et retribuam
tibi mercedem tuam. Qui post annos septem
ipso natalitio apostolorum die cum missarum solemnia
peregisset, et mysteria sacrae communionis accepisset,
e corpore exivit.</P></DIV2> <DIV2 COM="0424" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0424"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>KEFAL. NH'.
Periú zwhðû kaiú teleiwvsewû Kassivou ejpiskovpou.</FOREIGN></HEAD> <COL N="0422C"></COL> <P COM="0422"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>PETROS. Qaumastav eijsin oæntwû pavnu aåper ajkouvw, kaiv
ouj metrivwû eujfraivnonta.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0422"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>G GRHGOR. 4Ina deú mhú hJmiðn eijû ajmfibolivan eælqwsin oiJ
lovgoi twðn nekrwðn, bebaiouðsi pavnta aiJ pravxeiû twðn zwvntwn.
2O gaúr thðé zwhðé eujlabhúû Kavssioû ojnovmati thðû Navrnhû
ejpivskopoû, oÝû kaq1 hJmevran twðé Qewðé qusivan ajnaivmakton
 <COL N="0422D"></COL> prosfevrein eiæwqen, metaú pollwðn</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>dakruvwn ejpitelwðn thðû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>dakruvwn deú telwðn thðû
iJeraðû qusivaû taú musthvria, eændon deú touð qusiasthrivou
uJpavrcontoû aujtouð ajpovfasin</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="g" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0422" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0422D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>paraú kurivou.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>paraú Qeouð ejdevxato di1
 <COL N="0423A"></COL> ojptasivaû tinoúû ijdivou aujtouð presbutevrou, levgontoû× 1Ergavzou,
oåper ejrgavzhé, mhú pauvshé oJ pouðû sou, mhdeú hJ ceivr
son. Thðé gaúr eJorthðé twðn aJgivwn D ajpostovlwn ejleuvseiû ejmoiú,
kaiú ajntapodwvsw soi toún misqovn sou. Metaú deú eJptaú eæth
