ejxwqouðtai, thðû ajlhqeivaû legouvshû× 1Eaún prosfevrhéû toú dwðrovn 
sou ejpiú toú qusiasthvrion, kaiú ejkeið mnhsqhðéû oåti oJ
ajdelfovû sou eæcei ti kataú souð,</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0427" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0427D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aæfeû toú dwðron sou keivmenon eæmprosqen.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aæfeû ejkeið toú dwðron eæmprosqen
