uJpavrcousi, noerwðû sunafqhðnai, kaiú aujtoiðû metaú tapeinwvsewû
thún yuchún</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0428" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0428D"></COL> Ms.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJpotavxai.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>uJpotavxasqai, kaiú diaú kaloqelivan
aujtoiðû eujaresthðsai. 2Hnivka gaúr oJ ktivsthû hJmwðn toiouðton
 <COL N="0427D"></COL> toún logismoún hJmwðn ejn X ajlhqeivaé toú eujavreston hJmwðn thðû
