kaiú pepoiqwúû levgw, oåti swthrivou qusivaû ouj
crhvzomen, ejaún proú touð qanavtou Qewðé qusiva aujtoiú uJpavrcwmen.</FOREIGN></P></DIV2></DIV1></DOC></BODY> <BACK><DOC NAME="Variae lectiones prolixiores" AUTHOR="Auctor incertus" STATUS=S TEMPSTAT=UNCERT SECOND=YES COM="0430"><COL N="0429"></COL> <HEAD TYPE=main COM="0429">VARIAE LECTIONES PROLIXIORES,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Quae brevibus notis comprehendi non potuerunt, litteris</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>A, B, G, D,</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">etc., designatae.</HI></HEAD> <P COM="0429"><COL N="0429B"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>A Qusiva proskomisqhvsetai pareuquúû ouøn ajpelqwún
ouåtw pepoivhken hJmwðn deú periú pragmavtwn eJtevrwn ajscoloumevnwn
kaiú taúû parercomevnaû hJmevraû mhú ajriqmouvntwn,
aujtoúû oJ teleuthvsaû ajdelfoúû ejn mivaé nuktiú kopiovswé twðé
gnhsivwé aujtouð ajdelfwðé kaq1 uåpnouû ejfavnh. Aujtoúû deú touðton
qeasavmenoû hjrwvthsen aujtoún levgwn, ajdelfeú ejn poivoiû
ejkeiðse uJpavrceiû. Proúû oÝn aujtoúû ajpekrivqh, eåwû meún touð
nuðn pavnu kakwðû uJphðrcon. 1Artivwû deú kalwðû uJpavrcw×
shvmeron gaúr thún aJgivan koinwnivan ajpevlabon. Touðto deú
