twðn aijwvnwn. 1Amhvn.</FOREIGN></P></DOC> <DOC NAME="Elenchus vocum Graecobarbararum" AUTHOR="Auctor incertus" STATUS=S TEMPSTAT=UNCERT SECOND=YES COM="0430"><COL N="0431"></COL> <HEAD TYPE=main COM="0431"><HI REND="ITALIC">Elenchus vocum Graecobarbararum quae in Dialogorum versione reperiuntur</HI> <NOTE N="(1)" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0431" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0431"></COL> In hoc elencho revocatur lector ad numeros in textu crassiori charactere expressos.  <ED>EDIT.</ED></NOTE> .</HEAD> <LIST COM="0431"><ITEM><COL N="0431A"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Adbokaðtoû,</FOREIGN>  Advocatus, 410.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Akoumbivzein,</FOREIGN>  accumbere, 279.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>3Arka,</FOREIGN>  arca, 171.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>3Arkla,</FOREIGN>  arcula, 187.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Dhnavrion,</FOREIGN>  denarium, 430.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Dhfevnswr,</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">vel</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>defevnswr,</FOREIGN>  defensor, 170, 247.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Deouvsdedit,</FOREIGN>  Deusdedit, 419.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Illouvstrioû,</FOREIGN>  illustris, 318.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kabouvlion,</FOREIGN>  cubiculum, 282.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kalivgion,</FOREIGN>  caliga, 158.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kavmpoû,</FOREIGN>  campus, 287.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kandhðlai,</FOREIGN>  candelae, 174.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kavraboû,</FOREIGN>  carabus, 470.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kavstron,</FOREIGN>  castrum, 367.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kevllh,</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kellivon,</FOREIGN>  cella, 166,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et saepe alias.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kodivmenta,</FOREIGN>  condimenta, 279.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kovmhû,</FOREIGN>  comes, 158.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kwmonitovrion,</FOREIGN>  commonitorium, 295.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=G